{
  "id": "elliott-impulse-01",
  "title": {
    "en": "A Five-Wave Impulse and A-B-C Correction",
    "bn": "পাঁচ-wave impulse ও A-B-C correction"
  },
  "symbol": "EURUSD",
  "timeframe": "H1",
  "mode": "synthetic",
  "type": "trade-setup",
  "bias": "bullish",
  "outcome": "win",
  "tags": [
    "elliott",
    "impulse",
    "corrective"
  ],
  "module": "16-advanced",
  "lessonSlugs": [
    "04-elliott-wave"
  ],
  "caption": {
    "en": "Waves 1 to 5 up, then A-B-C down. Wave 2 stayed above the start of wave 1, wave 3 was the longest, wave 4 did not overlap the top of wave 1. Buy the end of wave 2 at 1.0853, stop under the start of wave 1.",
    "bn": "Wave 1 থেকে 5 ওপরে, তারপর A-B-C নিচে। Wave 2 wave 1-এর শুরুর ওপরে ছিল, wave 3 সবচেয়ে বড়, wave 4 wave 1-এর top ছোঁয়নি। Wave 2-এর শেষে 1.0853-এ buy, stop wave 1-এর শুরুর নিচে।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "A wave count gives a clear invalidation level, which is the part that is genuinely useful for risk.",
    "bn": "Wave count একটি স্পষ্ট invalidation level দেয়, যা ঝুঁকি নির্ধারণে আসলেই কাজের।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Use the count for its invalidation level, not as a prediction",
      "bn": "Count-কে ভবিষ্যদ্বাণী নয়, invalidation level হিসেবে ব্যবহার করুন"
    }
  ],
